# Makefile for Emergency Consensus Mode Tests
CXX = g++
CXXFLAGS = -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -O2 -g
INCLUDES = -I../include -I../lib/nlohmann_json/single_include
LIBS = -pthread

# Source files
EMERGENCY_MODE_SOURCES = ../src/core/emergency_consensus_mode.cpp \
                        ../src/core/consensus_harmony.cpp \
                        ../src/core/consensus_harmony_manager.cpp \
                        ../src/core/consensus_router.cpp \
                        ../src/core/consensus_balancer.cpp \
                        ../src/core/consensus_monitor.cpp \
                        ../src/core/logger.cpp

# Test files
TEST_SIMPLE = test_emergency_consensus_mode_simple
TEST_COMPREHENSIVE = emergency_consensus_mode_test

# Object files
EMERGENCY_MODE_OBJECTS = $(EMERGENCY_MODE_SOURCES:.cpp=.o)

# Default target
all: $(TEST_SIMPLE)

# Simple test (no external dependencies)
$(TEST_SIMPLE): tests/test_emergency_consensus_mode_simple.cpp $(EMERGENCY_MODE_OBJECTS)
	$(CXX) $(CXXFLAGS) $(INCLUDES) -o $@ $^ $(LIBS)

# Comprehensive test (requires Google Test)
$(TEST_COMPREHENSIVE): tests/emergency_consensus_mode_test.cpp $(EMERGENCY_MODE_OBJECTS)
	$(CXX) $(CXXFLAGS) $(INCLUDES) -o $@ $^ $(LIBS) -lgtest -lgtest_main

# Object file compilation
%.o: %.cpp
	$(CXX) $(CXXFLAGS) $(INCLUDES) -c $< -o $@

# Run simple test
run-simple: $(TEST_SIMPLE)
	./$(TEST_SIMPLE)

# Run comprehensive test
run-comprehensive: $(TEST_COMPREHENSIVE)
	./$(TEST_COMPREHENSIVE)

# Run all tests
test: run-simple

# Clean build artifacts
clean:
	rm -f $(TEST_SIMPLE) $(TEST_COMPREHENSIVE) $(EMERGENCY_MODE_OBJECTS)
	rm -f tests/test_emergency_consensus_mode_simple.o tests/emergency_consensus_mode_test.o

# Install dependencies (Ubuntu/Debian)
install-deps:
	sudo apt-get update
	sudo apt-get install -y build-essential libgtest-dev cmake
	cd /usr/src/gtest && sudo cmake . && sudo make && sudo cp *.a /usr/lib

# Debug build
debug: CXXFLAGS += -DDEBUG -g3
debug: $(TEST_SIMPLE)

# Release build
release: CXXFLAGS += -DNDEBUG -O3
release: $(TEST_SIMPLE)

# Help
help:
	@echo "Available targets:"
	@echo "  all              - Build simple test (default)"
	@echo "  $(TEST_SIMPLE)   - Build simple test"
	@echo "  $(TEST_COMPREHENSIVE) - Build comprehensive test (requires Google Test)"
	@echo "  run-simple       - Run simple test"
	@echo "  run-comprehensive - Run comprehensive test"
	@echo "  test             - Run all available tests"
	@echo "  clean            - Clean build artifacts"
	@echo "  install-deps     - Install dependencies"
	@echo "  debug            - Build with debug flags"
	@echo "  release          - Build with release flags"
	@echo "  help             - Show this help"

.PHONY: all run-simple run-comprehensive test clean install-deps debug release help